349| \begin{definition}[阶梯算符]\label{def:b3:quantum-model-systems:ladder}
350| 设 $x_0 = \sqrt{\hbar/m\omega}$，\emph{阶梯算符}\index{阶梯算符}为
351| =
352| =
353| \[
354| \hat a = \frac{1}{\sqrt2}\Big(\frac{\hat x}{x_0} + \frac{\iu x_0\hat p}{\hbar}\Big),
355| \qquad \hat a^\dagger = \frac{1}{\sqrt2}\Big(\frac{\hat x}{x_0} -
356| \frac{\iu x_0\hat p}{\hbar}\Big).
357| \]
